{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const assetPathPrefix = \"https://www.figma.com/api/mcp/asset/4e8170b1-e4bd-4332-a7af-44b478efc57b\";\nconst imgAuthorPortrait = `${assetPathPrefix}/90b4a.png`;\nconst imgBookArtwork = `${assetPathPrefix}/356ef.png`;\nconst imgIconBook = `${assetPathPrefix}/40b09.svg`;\nconst imgIconHeadphone = `${assetPathPrefix}/19477.svg`;\n\ntype CastleHomePromoProps = {\n  className?: string;\n  slide?: \"Exclusive\" | \"Formats\";\n};\n\nfunction CastleHomePromo({ className, slide = \"Exclusive\" }: CastleHomePromoProps) {\n  const isExclusive = slide === \"Exclusive\";\n  const isFormats = slide === \"Formats\";\n  return (\n    <div className={className || \"bg-[var(--castle-color-action-tint,rgba(74,143,255,0.08))] content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[12px] h-[252px] items-center justify-center p-[20px] relative rounded-[var(--castle-dimension-24,24px)] w-[358px]\"} id={isFormats ? \"node-124_378\" : \"node-124_376\"}>\n      <div className=\"content-stretch flex gap-[var(--castle-dimension-12,12px)] h-[192px] items-center overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[318px]\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_404\" : \"node-124_380\"} data-name=\"Promo content\">\n        <div className=\"[word-break:break-word] content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[var(--castle-dimension-12,12px)] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[190px]\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_405\" : \"node-124_381\"} data-name=\"Copy\">\n          <div className=\"font-['Manrope:SemiBold'] font-semibold leading-[0] relative shrink-0 text-[20px] text-[color:var(--castle-color-text-primary,#101012)] tracking-[-0.2px] w-full\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_406\" : \"node-124_382\"}>\n            <p className=\"leading-[26px] mb-0\">{isFormats ? \"Книги в удобном\" : \"«Файл надежды»\"}</p>\n            <p className=\"leading-[26px]\">{isFormats ? \"формате\" : \"только у нас\"}</p>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"font-['Manrope:Regular'] font-normal leading-[0] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--castle-color-text-secondary,rgba(60,60,67,0.72))] w-full\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_407\" : \"node-124_383\"}>\n            <p className=\"leading-[20px] mb-0\">{isFormats ? \"Электронные и аудиокниги.\" : \"История про любовь,\"}</p>\n            <p className=\"leading-[20px]\">{isFormats ? \"Выбирайте свою историю.\" : \"смерть и робота\"}</p>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"font-['Manrope:Regular'] font-normal leading-[20px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--castle-color-action-accent,#4a8fff)] w-full\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_408\" : \"node-124_384\"}>\n            {isFormats ? \"Выбрать книгу\" : \"Подробнее\"}\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"h-[168px] relative shrink-0 w-[116px]\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_409\" : \"node-124_385\"} data-name=\"Artwork\">\n          {isExclusive && (\n            <>\n              <div className=\"absolute h-[132px] left-0 rounded-[16px] top-0 w-[116px]\" data-node-id=\"124:386\" data-name=\"Author portrait\">\n                <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute inset-0 max-w-none object-cover pointer-events-none rounded-[16px] size-full\" src={imgAuthorPortrait} />\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"absolute h-[87px] left-[-8px] rounded-[4px] top-[78px] w-[58px]\" data-node-id=\"124:387\" data-name=\"Book artwork\">\n                <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute inset-0 max-w-none object-contain pointer-events-none rounded-[4px] size-full\" src={imgBookArtwork} />\n              </div>\n            </>\n          )}\n          {isFormats && (\n            <>\n              <div className=\"absolute bg-[var(--castle-color-surface,white)] content-stretch flex items-center justify-center left-0 overflow-clip rounded-[9999px] size-[72px] top-0\" data-node-id=\"124:410\" data-name=\"Format symbol\">\n                <div className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[40px]\" data-node-id=\"124:411\" data-name=\"Icon / book\">\n                  <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgIconBook} />\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"absolute bg-[var(--castle-color-surface,white)] content-stretch flex items-center justify-center left-[44px] overflow-clip rounded-[9999px] size-[72px] top-[88px]\" data-node-id=\"124:415\" data-name=\"Format symbol\">\n                <div className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[40px]\" data-node-id=\"124:416\" data-name=\"Icon / headphone\">\n                  <img alt=\"\" className=\"absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full\" src={imgIconHeadphone} />\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div className=\"content-stretch flex gap-[var(--castle-dimension-8,8px)] h-[8px] items-start justify-center overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[318px]\" id={isFormats ? \"node-124_422\" : \"node-124_388\"} data-name=\"Carousel pagination\">\n        {isExclusive && (\n          <>\n            <div className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-action-accent,#4a8fff)] h-[8px] relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 w-[24px]\" data-node-id=\"124:389\" data-name=\"Slide / Exclusive\" />\n            <button className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-border-default,rgba(120,120,128,0.16))] block cursor-pointer relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 size-[8px]\" data-node-id=\"124:390\" data-name=\"Slide / Subscription\" />\n            <button className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-border-default,rgba(120,120,128,0.16))] block cursor-pointer relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 size-[8px]\" data-node-id=\"124:391\" data-name=\"Slide / Formats\" />\n          </>\n        )}\n        {isFormats && (\n          <>\n            <button className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-border-default,rgba(120,120,128,0.16))] block cursor-pointer relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 size-[8px]\" data-node-id=\"124:423\" data-name=\"Slide / Exclusive\" />\n            <button className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-border-default,rgba(120,120,128,0.16))] block cursor-pointer relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 size-[8px]\" data-node-id=\"124:424\" data-name=\"Slide / Subscription\" />\n            <div className=\"bg-[var(--castle-color-action-accent,#4a8fff)] h-[8px] relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0 w-[24px]\" data-node-id=\"124:425\" data-name=\"Slide / Formats\" />\n          </>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}"},{"type":"text","text":"SUPER CRITICAL: The generated React+Tailwind code MUST be converted to match the target project's technology stack and styling system.\n1. Analyze the target codebase to identify: technology stack, styling approach, component patterns, and design tokens\n2. Convert React syntax to the target framework/library\n3. Transform all Tailwind classes to the target styling system while preserving exact visual design\n4. Follow the project's existing patterns and conventions\nDO NOT install any Tailwind as a dependency unless the user instructs you to do so.\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Node ids have been added to the code as data attributes, e.g. `data-node-id=\"1:2\"`."},{"type":"text","text":"These styles are contained in the design: Castle / Books / Section: Font(family: \"Manrope\", style: SemiBold, size: 20, weight: 600, lineHeight: 26, letterSpacing: -1), Castle / Books / Small: Font(family: \"Manrope\", style: Regular, size: 14, weight: 400, lineHeight: 20, letterSpacing: 0)."},{"type":"text","text":"Component descriptions: The following components have usage descriptions or documentation links defined in Figma. These descriptions provide important context about the intended usage, best practices, and any constraints for each component. Follow these guidelines when implementing or using these components.\n\n## Castle / Home / Promo\n**Node ID:** 124:379\n\nThree editable promo slides adapted from reference: exclusive book, subscription, digital formats. Blue brand tokens in both themes; artwork cropped as discrete assets.\n\n## Castle / Icon / book\n**Node ID:** 62:39\n\nVector paths from castle.fig, source 6413:314. Local copy.\n\n## Castle / Icon / headphone\n**Node ID:** 62:43\n\nVector paths from castle.fig, source 6413:119. Local copy."},{"type":"text","text":"The generated code contains image and SVG URL constants, e.g. const image = `${assetPathPrefix}/<asset file name>`, where assetPathPrefix is declared once at the top of the code and every asset URL interpolates it. These URLs are temporary download sources and expire after 7 days. Download each asset into the project with curl -L, then replace its URL in the generated code with a reference to the downloaded asset. Never use the temporary URLs as runtime image sources."},{"type":"image","data":"","mimeType":"image/png"}],"structuredContent":null,"isError":false}
